rgence Production Technology and Systems, Beijing, China","size":8.966400146484375,"flags":4}]}]},{"type":0,"bbox":[45.49599838256836,262.2110290527344,441.552978515625,424.5123291015625],"lines":[{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,262.2110290527344,440.1741638183594,271.0873107910156],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) is a technique that enhances the capabilities of large language models","size":8.876283645629883,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.558998107910156,273.0354309082031,441.1573181152344,282.091064453125],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"(LLMs)","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"by","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"incorporating","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"external","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"knowledge","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"sources.","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"This","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"method","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"addresses","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"common","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"LLM","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"limitations,","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,283.9944152832031,441.1610107421875,293.050048828125],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"including outdated information and the tendency to produce inaccurate \"hallucinated\" content. However,","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,294.95343017578125,440.17333984375,304.0090637207031],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"evaluating","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"RAG","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"systems","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"is","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"a","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"challenge.","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"Most","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"current","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"benchmarks","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"mainly","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"focus","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"on","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":" ","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4},{"text":"question-answering","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,305.9358215332031,440.4012451171875,314.9602966308594],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"applications, and neglect the wider range of scenarios where RAG could be beneficial. Moreover, they only","size":9.024493217468262,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,316.9620056152344,440.1699523925781,325.8969421386719],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"evaluate the performance of LLM components of RAG pipeline in the experiments, and neglect the influence","size":8.934962272644043,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,327.8471374511719,440.34271240234375,336.8805236816406],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"of retrieval components and external knowledge database construction. To address these issues, this paper","size":9.033397674560547,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,338.9240417480469,440.1742858886719,347.8003234863281],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"constructs a large-scale and more comprehensive benchmark, and evaluates all the components of RAG systems","size":8.876283645629883,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,349.755126953125,440.1762390136719,358.8018493652344],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"in various RAG application scenarios. Specifically, we refer to the CRUD actions that describe interactions","size":9.046737670898438,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,360.7064208984375,440.17333984375,369.7620544433594],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"between users and knowledge bases, and also categorize the range of RAG applications into four distinct","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,371.6654357910156,440.1733703613281,380.7210693359375],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"types—Create, Read, Update, and Delete (CRUD). \"Create\" refers to scenarios requiring the generation of","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,382.7082214355469,441.552978515625,391.6521911621094],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"original, varied content. \"Read\" involves responding to intricate questions in knowledge-intensive situations.","size":8.943955421447754,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,393.58343505859375,440.1732482910156,402.6390686035156],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"\"Update\" focuses on revising and rectifying inaccuracies or inconsistencies in pre-existing texts. \"Delete\"","size":9.055620193481445,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,404.6770324707031,441.1585388183594,413.5533142089844],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"pertains to the task of summarizing extensive texts into more concise forms. For each of these CRUD categories,","size":8.876283645629883,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.49599838256836,415.63604736328125,440.1762390136719,424.5123291015625],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"we have developed different datasets to evaluate the performance of RAG systems. We also analyze the effects","size":8.876283645629883,"flags":4}]}]},{"type":0,"bbox":[45.827999114990234,438.6990966796875,209.9470672607422,458.3262634277344],"lines":[{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,438.6990966796875,209.9470672607422,448.21624755859375],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"∗","size":6.176799774169922,"flags":4},{"text":"Both authors contributed equally to this research.","size":7.970099925994873,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,448.8091125488281,123.6256332397461,458.3262634277344],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"†","size":6.176799774169922,"flags":4},{"text":"Corresponding author.","size":7.970099925994873,"flags":4}]}]},{"type":0,"bbox":[10.940000534057617,141.3599853515625,37.619998931884766,488.0],"lines":[{"bbox":[10.940000534057617,141.3599853515625,37.619998931884766,488.0],"dir":[0.0,-1.0],"spans":[{"text":"arXiv:2401.17043v2  [cs.CL]  19 Feb 2024","size":20.0,"flags":4}]}]},{"type":0,"bbox":[45.54899978637695,474.8602600097656,441.0487060546875,562.5512084960938],"lines":[{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,474.8602600097656,440.7337341308594,482.85821533203125],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"Authors’ addresses: Yuanjie Lyu, University of Science and Technology of China, Hefei, China, s1583050085@gmail.com;","size":7.997946262359619,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,484.8461608886719,441.0444641113281,492.8122863769531],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"Zhiyu Li, Institute for Advanced Algorithms Research (Shanghai), China, lizy@iaar.ac.cn; Simin Niu, niusimi@ruc.edu.cn,","size":7.966114044189453,"flags":4}]},{"bbox":[45.827999114990234,494.74664306640625,440.32012939453125,502.7960510253906],"dir":[1.0,0.0],"spans":[{"text":"Renmin University of China, Beijing, China; Feiyu Xiong, xiongfy@iaar.ac.cn; Bo Tang, t